		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=678#comment-4001</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[for Merybehn

&quot;You are &#039;there&#039;, I &#039;here&#039;. Worlds separate us,
Death&#039;s angels, the void of space...
Yet I say your name, and waves of Light
Wash to me silently from your Heart.&quot;

- Jalal-ud-Din Rumi]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>for Merybehn</p>
<p>&#8220;You are &#8216;there&#8217;, I &#8216;here&#8217;. Worlds separate us,<br />
Death&#8217;s angels, the void of space&#8230;<br />
Yet I say your name, and waves of Light<br />
Wash to me silently from your Heart.&#8221;</p>
<p>&#8211; Jalal-ud-Din Rumi</p>
]]></content:encoded>
